# Security / data

Read `docs/SECURITY.md` before changing auth, permissions, APIs, Supabase clients, RLS, storage, payroll/quotes money paths, or production data.

For schema, SQL, RLS, backfill, or production-data work, also load `.cursor/rules/database-migrations.mdc` and the migration guides. Do not invent an alternate migration method.

Client permission hooks and nav filters are UX only. Server authorization and RLS are the security boundaries. Do not treat JWT `user_metadata` or editable profile fields as permission truth.

View As must use the effective role/team snapshot and must not restore the actor’s real Level 5 access.
